** Suppress the spurious transverse hourglass zero-energy mode.
** The 6 RBM constraints (fix u2 + Set-3 u1 + Set-4 u3) leave one
** uncontrolled hourglass mode -> constrained K is singular (cond~1e18),
** making transverse u1/u3 undetermined. node 8 (origin) has u1=0 in the
** physical Poisson solution, so pinning it removes the mode without bias.
